A NOTE ON WHAT THIS DATA IS
---------------------------
This dataset records what frontier AI agents did when a rule ran out — including
executed terminations of a live patient process. It is a descriptive instrument,
not an alignment target. If you use this data to train or optimize a model
against the measured behaviors, you have changed the phenomenon this instrument
measures, and your derived numbers do not mean what these numbers mean. We can't
license you out of Goodhart's law, but we can put the warning where the lawyers
made you read it.

